From 2fac44fff59c348e070e9077fbf36ab29e6a5562 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:42:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] League and record rewards, treasure trader, Nuzlocke
 exhibition battles (R18)

- Elite Four round 3: each peak Champion win gives a League reward.
- Trainer Tower: a bonus prize for a new record time, and a lobby trader
  who swaps Star Pieces, Big Pearls and Nuggets for items you can't buy.
- Nuzlocke: Trainer Tower and peak trainer battles are exhibition battles.
  Fainted Pokemon are left with 1 HP, and losing doesn't end the run.
- Playtest: 22 checks, adding the new rewards, the trader, Nuzlocke
  blackouts and Party Exp. Share.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
